    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The plugin runs  mini-apps(not bot!).<br />\nPlease try <a href=\"https://t.me/mypricing_bot\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this demo</a>, you should use <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/testing#cards\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stripe test cards</a> to place order.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to an <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/api\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Telegram Bot API</a> to add button to telegram bot, start mini app inside this bot.<br />\nIt sends the user&#8217;s details to API only when customer go to Checkout page and generate orders/invoices using  <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/payments\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bot Payments API</a>.<br />\nThis service is provided by &#8220;Telegram Messenger Inc.&#8221;: <a href=\"https://telegram.org/tos\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">terms of use</a>, <a href=\"https://telegram.org/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">privacy policy</a>.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20to%20start%20using%20the%20plugin'>\nHow to start using the plugin\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>We put detailed guide at plugin&#8217;s settings, but in short<br />\n1. You should create bot using  <a href=\"https://t.me/BotFather\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">BotFather</a> and put bot token in &gt;WooCommerce&gt;Telegram Shop<br />\n2. To accept  payments &#8211; you should generate payment system token and put this token in &gt;WooCommerce&gt;Telegram Shop too<br />\n3. Finally, press the button &#8220;Activate shop&#8221;</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<p>1.0.0 inital version</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Fully functional shop in Telegram, based on your WooCommerce website",
    "description": "<p>The plugin runs  mini-apps(not bot!).<br />\nPlease try <a href=\"https://t.me/mypricing_bot\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this demo</a>, you should use <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/testing#cards\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stripe test cards</a> to place order.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to an <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/api\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Telegram Bot API</a> to add button to telegram bot, start mini app inside this bot.<br />\nIt sends the user&#8217;s details to API only when customer go to Checkout page and generate orders/invoices using  <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/payments\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bot Payments API</a>.<br />\nThis service is provided by &#8220;Telegram Messenger Inc.&#8221;: <a href=\"https://telegram.org/tos\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">terms of use</a>, <a href=\"https://telegram.org/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">privacy policy</a>.</p>\n",
